# gen83: named entity detection. Capitalized words in user turns are
# collected as entity candidates throughout the session.
> my dog is called Rex
< Got it: your dog is called Rex.
> I also know Luna and Max
< I don't understand that yet.
> what names have i mentioned?
< You mentioned: Rex, Luna, Max.

